(param &bg Color (8))
(param &fill Color (4))
(param &outline Color (3))
(param &ring_width number (1))

(exclude ($Boxed $Band) "Every shape in the pairs is a rectangle with a solid border, and that separates neither class, so $Boxed with $Band is left out: where a box's border is not a solid shape, some bg cell on that border is both inside the box and one step off the shape, so the two readings claim it for different colors. Where the border is solid, that combination agrees with $Boxed and $Ring everywhere.")
